      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "one candidate evaluation\nsplit_theta() ->\nrecover_full_weights() /\nrecover_full_trans_matrix()\npenalty return on NA or off-box\nsnap w < 1e-4, edges < 1e-5\ndim <- c(N, m*K): column (k-1)m+i\nis hypothesis i at look k, so the\nreshape is free (column-major)\ngraph_shortcut_gsd():\n  K passes of the SAME cascade,\n  graph state carried look to look,\n  time(set,i) = k+1 on rejection,\n  early exit at sumrej == m,\n  strict < keeps K = 1 identical\n-> rejected N x m, time N x m\ncompiled gain on time -> scalar\nnew . P4",
      "originalText": "one candidate evaluation\nsplit_theta() ->\nrecover_full_weights() /\nrecover_full_trans_matrix()\npenalty return on NA or off-box\nsnap w < 1e-4, edges < 1e-5\ndim <- c(N, m*K): column (k-1)m+i\nis hypothesis i at look k, so the\nreshape is free (column-major)\ngraph_shortcut_gsd():\n  K passes of the SAME cascade,\n  graph state carried look to look,\n  time(set,i) = k+1 on rejection,\n  early exit at sumrej == m,\n  strict < keeps K = 1 identical\n-> rejected N x m, time N x m\ncompiled gain on time -> scalar\nnew . P4",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n--evaluate",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "index": "b0G"
